<%- include('header') %>

<div class="container" style="padding: 40px 24px; max-width: 800px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p style="color: #8B949E; margin-bottom: 32px;">Last updated: February 2026</p>

  <div style="line-height: 1.7; color: #C9D1D9;">

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you create an account, we collect your email address, display name, username, and password (stored securely hashed).</p>
    <p><strong>Profile Information:</strong> Profile photo, bio, and city you provide.</p>
    <p><strong>Location Data:</strong> With your permission, we collect your device location to show nearby events. You can revoke this at any time through your device settings.</p>
    <p><strong>Usage Data:</strong> We collect information about how you use the app, including events viewed, attended, and interactions.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>To provide and maintain the Fluttrr service</li>
      <li>To show you relevant local events based on your location and preferences</li>
      <li>To send you notifications about events you've joined</li>
      <li>To process business subscription payments via Stripe</li>
      <li>To communicate important service updates</li>
      <li>To maintain safety and enforce our community guidelines</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">3. Information Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only in these cases:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
      <li><strong>With event organizers:</strong> Your display name and profile photo when you join an event</li>
      <li><strong>With other users:</strong> Your public profile information, moments, and event attendance</li>
      <li><strong>With service providers:</strong> Stripe (payments), Cloudflare (hosting), Expo (push notifications), Google Maps (geocoding)</li>
      <li><strong>When required by law:</strong> To comply with legal obligations or protect safety</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including encrypted passwords, HTTPS, rate limiting, and input sanitization. However, no system is 100% secure.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">5. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>Access and update your personal information through the app</li>
      <li>Delete your account and associated data by contacting us</li>
      <li>Opt out of push notifications through your device settings</li>
      <li>Revoke location permissions through your device settings</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">6. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your data as long as your account is active. Deleted accounts are purged within 30 days. Expired OTP codes and stories are automatically cleaned up.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Fluttrr is not intended for users under 18. We do not knowingly collect information from minors.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We'll notify you of significant changes through the app.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; color: #E6EDF3;">9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@fluttrr.com">hello@fluttrr.com</a></p>

  </div>
</div>

